                "text": "Fairfax\u2019s vibrant economy is key to Virginia\u2019s continued success. \n\nBut Trump Administration policies \u2014 federal job cuts, contract cancellations, tariffs, and health care cuts \u2014 are doing damage. \n\nWe need to come together as Virginians to fight for Virginia\u2019s economy and Virginia\u2019s jobs. I appreciate the opportunity to speak with @VAChamber about how we can overcome the current challenges.",
